      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's actually pretty good. i like the \"peel back the layers of misinformation\" part. for the first episode, i want to talk about the recent stuff with the new economic policies and how they're basically just helping the big corporations while the average family can barely afford eggs. can you write a segment where the host explains why these policies are a complete joke and just show how the system is rigged against us?",
